# Quote.astro's attribution is spaced by its line breaks: "— Name, Role" takes
# a space after the dash and none before the comma. Prettier 3.9 rewraps that
# line, which glues the dash to the name and pushes a space in front of the
# comma — a visible change on every quote on the site. Formatting it means
# first moving that punctuation somewhere wrapping can't reach.
